  H0: Theta(last) = 0
  Wald chi2(1) = 4.1283, p-value = 0.0422
  REJECT H0 -> the last MA lag is significant.

All cross effects jointly:
  H0: every off-diagonal coefficient of Gamma and Theta = 0
